										   <div id="lessid--4" class="loc-det-rev__rtitle__localtxt addReadMore showlesscontent">Borivali is the best area to stay in Mumbai. The majority of businesspeople who own share market offices, Diamond merchants, and Jewelers are occupying residential property as well as commercial property. All are staying at peace and enjoying life with family and friends. The majority area of Boriva... <a href="javascript:void(0);" class="loc-det__livablityblock__review-text__cta" onclick="toggleDisc('readMoreAbt','-4');">Read More</a></div>
										   <div id="specificTextId--4" class="loc-det-rev__rtitle__localtxt addReadMore showlesscontent" style="display: none;">Borivali is the best area to stay in Mumbai. The majority of businesspeople who own share market offices, Diamond merchants, and Jewelers are occupying residential property as well as commercial property. All are staying at peace and enjoying life with family and friends. The majority area of Borivali is redeveloped or redeveloping. All major Brands have their outlet in the Borivali area, as Borivali People have a good taste of style. <a href="javascript:void(0);" class="loc-det__livablityblock__review-text__cta" onclick="toggleDisc('hideMoreAbt','-4');">Read Less</a></div>
									   
									   
								
