								   <div class="loc-det__builderswiper__b-dec">With an entrepreneurial spirit, talent and a deep sense of commitment to community, "DIPTI GROUP" began a home-building company in Mumbai in 1982.
Since then, Dipti Group has been designing and developing majestic and impressive abodes in some of the finest locations in Mumbai, Kolhapur, Gujarat, Deolali, Talegaon and Lonavala. Over the years, Dipti Group has, successfully, brick by brick, home by home, built a stellar reputation for which Quality, Style and Innovation have served as a strong foundation.
Dipti Group is not only recognized as a premier builder in the world of real estate, but also has a strong client base of satisfied and happy customers that continues to grow every day.

