						</div>
						<div class="loc-det__builderswiper__infoblock">
							<div class="loc-det__builderswiper__top-info">
								<a href="https://www.magicbricks.com/Kaustubh-Construction-Pvt.-Ltd.-buid-4d423631313637" target="_blank" class="loc-det__builderswiper__b-name" onclick="event.stopPropagation();">Kaustubh Construction Pvt. Ltd.</a>
								<div class="loc-det__builderswiper__b-since"><span class="loc-det__builderswiper__b-since__ttl">Since</span>1995</div>
								
								   <div class="loc-det__builderswiper__b-dec">We, would like to introduce ourselves as a growing construction company in Mumbai, we are in the construction business since last more than 15 years. We have immense confidence in our work, our construction process, designs, methodologies and materials and we stand by what we do.Our company has established a strong reputation for innovating designs, quality construction and timely completion of projects. Our activities branch out to real estate development, construction, facility management. Our company has team of experts in real estate development. Our business focuses on Real Estate Development including construction and development of residential, commercial &amp; retail projects.Providing Quality Construction and timely possession to our customers is our prime motto. Our projects are distinguished by their high quality and the unique manner in which they create an ideal living and working environment. To accomplish this, we pay acute attention to landscaping parks, shopping and recreational facilities. These features, in turn lead to a high demand for our projects. A deep study of the market and a strong feeling to meet the needs of all categories of income groups prompted our company to help these people tide over difficult times and harrowing experiences of buying a home.With numerous projects to our credit and loads of happy and satisfied home buyers, our company has carved a niche for itself in the real estate industry. Today, our company has several projects underway in the Western and Eastern suburbs of Mumbai catering to the customer with varied needs and tastes.</div>
									
								
								
							</div>
							<div class="loc-det__builderswiper__bottom-info">
