    <!-- Popoup Sections Start -->
        
        <!-- about locality popup start  -->
        <div class="popup__props__bg loc__detail__no" id="loc__detail">
            <div class="popup__props__container large">
                <div class="popup__props__heading">
                    <div class="popup__props__title">About Borivali West</div>
                    <div class="popup__props__close"></div>
                    <div class="clearAll"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="popup__props__bodycontainer">
                    <div class="popup__props__body">
                      
                        <div class="popup__props__body__heading">Locality introduction and neighbourhood</div>
                        <div class="popup__props__body__text">Situated in the northern part of Mumbai, Borivali West is a developed residential suburb that majorly caters to the upper-mid segment. The locality is located along the Western line of the Mumbai Suburban Railway and majorly hosts multi-storey apartments spread across various completed and under-construction projects. Also, there are several co-operative housing societies situated here. Prominent residential projects in the locality are Satra Park, Ajmera Pristine, and Paradigm Ananda Residency.</div>
                     
                      
                        <div class="popup__props__body__heading">Physical infrastructure</div>
                        <div class="popup__props__body__text">The locality shares widespread connectivity through the SV Road, Link Road and Western Express Highway. Also, the area is directly connected through Borivali Railway Station placed on the western line of the Mumbai suburban railway network. Besides, there is sufficient availability of BEST buses and auto rickshaws in the locality. Moreover, the under-construction metro Line 2 (Dahisar-Mandale) is expected to boost connectivity with the rest of the city and is scheduled to be completed by 2020.</div>
                     
                        
                        <div class="popup__props__body__heading">Social & retail infra</div>
                        <div class="popup__props__body__text">In terms of social infrastructure, Borivali West comprises of several schools, hospitals, shopping malls, market complexes and banks. Some of the prominent schools in the neighbourhood are Don Bosco High School, Swami Vivekanand International School and St. Xavier's High School. Besides, major hospitals include Karuna Hospital, Apex Superspeciality Hospitals and Lotus Multispeciality Hospital. Also, popular shopping avenues here are Zoom Plaza Mall, Moksh Plaza Mall, Raghuleela Mega Mall, and Reliance Mall.</div>
                     
                      
                        <div class="popup__props__body__heading">Nearby employment hubs</div>
                        <div class="popup__props__body__text">The locality has connectivity with the prominent job hubs situated across the areas of Malad, Goregaon and Andheri, which are accessible through the SV Road, Link Road and Western Express Highway. These include Infinity IT Park, Express Zone, Mindspace Malad, NESCO IT Park and Blue Rose Industrial Estate, among others.Source : Magicbricks Research</div>
                    
                     
