         <!-- mbtv youtube video content popup start  -->
		 <div class="popup__props__bg mbtv_video_cntnt" id="mbtv__detail">
            <div class="popup__props__container large">
                <div class="popup__props__heading">
                    <div class="popup__props__title">About Borivali West</div>
                    <div class="popup__props__close"></div>
                    <div class="clearAll"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="popup__props__bodycontainer">
                    <div class="popup__props__body">
                        <div class="popup__props__body__text">Borivali West is a developed locality of north Mumbai. It is an upmarket locality as it offers properties to fit every budget, along with the connectivity advantage.<div><br /></div><div> Connectivity and Transport Facilities of Borivali West </div><div><br /></div><div>The Western Express Highway runs parallel to Borivali West. Using this you can easily reach the commercial hubs like BKC, Mindspace, and Infinity IT Park within 30-40 minutes. Borivali West has good connectivity to the neighboring localities including Kandivali, Shimpoli, Gorai, Dahisar, IC Colony, and Mandapeshwar by Link road, Gorai Road, SV Road, Devidas Road, and other internal roads.  Further, the Devidas Road also leads you to Borivali East and the Western Express Highway.</div><div><br /></div><div><span id="docs-internal-guid-fc8a7734-7fff-ed24-2999-f8df52192938"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">The Borivali Railway Station is situated on the SV Road right beside the locality, which is a halt for local as well as outstation trains. Moreover, residents also board local trains from </span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Dahisar and Kandivali railway stations as well, which are also in proximity. The Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport is 23 km away and can be reached in 30-40 minutes via the Western Express Highway. People here use</span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> </span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">auto-rickshaws, taxis, BEST buses and Trains for commuting within and around Borivali which are easily accessible.&nbsp;</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">The connectivity of Borivali West will be enhanced with two upcoming metro lines- viz. Line 2 (Dahisar-DN Nagar) and Line 7 (Dahisar -Andheri)</span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">. These metro lines </span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">are expected to significantly reduce travel time and the congestion faced by people at the Western Express Highway and SV Road. </span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Apart from the upcoming two metro lines</span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">, </span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">there are many key infrastructure projects that are expected to impact Boriwali west&rsquo;s realty market. The Mumbai Urban Transport Project (MUTP 3A) is developing a suburban line between Borivali and Virar. Mumbai Metropolitan Region Development Authority (MMRDA) along with Western Railway (WR) and Central Railway (CR) is all set to extend Harbour Line till Borivali station.&nbsp;</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;<span style="background-color: transparent; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: 700; white-space: pre-wrap;">Social Infrastructure of Borivali West</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Borivali West also boasts of a lot of reputed schools, hospitals, colleges, and restaurants. For daily needs, residents go to supermarkets available within the locality. The local population benefits due to the presence of malls like 'Indraprastha', one of the earliest in Mumbai. In addition, there are various other shopping complexes like Moksh plaza Mall and Raghuleela Mall located within a radius of 5km and can be reached in 15 minutes. Retail outlets, shops, and boutiques offer good options for retail therapy.</span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> </span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">St. Lawrence high school, Witty International School, and St Francis ICSE school are popular schools located within the locality. Shri Harilal Bhagwati Municipal hospital, Lotus Multispeciality hospital, and Karuna hospital are some of the known hospitals located within the locality. Essel world, Water Kingdom, Maxus Cinema, Pagoda, and Gorai beach are key attractions of the area.</span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">&nbsp;The major demand driver of this locality is its vicinity to commercial destinations like </span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Express Zone, BKC, Mindspace, and Infinity IT Park in Malad, and Nesco IT Park in Goregaon. Borivali West is a residence of choice of the IT professionals working in these areas.&nbsp;</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Borivali West is densely populated. </span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">In certain pockets like I.C colony, LIC colony, Shanti Ashram, Dev Nagar, Chikuwadi, Shimpoli, Mahavir Nagar, and Gorai, there is a mix of linguistics, ethnicities, and NRI&rsquo;s. There are a lot of gardens and parks in the residential areas of the locality. It also has an auditorium</span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-style: italic; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">, </span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">amphitheater, and playground. </span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Residents enjoy a facility of 24 hours of water and electricity. The presence of </span><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sanjay_Gandhi_National_Park" style="text-decoration-line: none;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Sanjay Gandhi National Park</span></a><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">, in the east and the mangroves in the west end of Borivali west offers green cover. Moreover, </span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">various apartment complexes of Borivali West are undergoing redevelopment.</span></p><br /><br /><br /><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Properties in Borivali West, Mumbai</span></p><br /><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">As per Magicbricks,&nbsp; 98% of the residential property supply in Borivali West is multi-storey apartments and a mere 2% is builder floor apartments.</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p><div dir="ltr" style="margin-left:0pt;" align="left"><table style="border:none;border-collapse:collapse;"><colgroup><col width="202"><col width="151"></colgroup><tbody><tr style="height:15pt"><td colspan="2" style="border-left:solid #cccccc 1.5pt;border-right:solid #000000 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-top:solid #000000 1.5pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Supply By Property Type</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:15pt"><td style="border-left:solid #cccccc 1.5pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.875pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Builder Floor Apartment</span></p></td><td style="border-left:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-right:solid #000000 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.875pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Multistorey Apartment</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:15pt"><td style="border-left:solid #cccccc 1.5pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1.5pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.875pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">2%</span></p></td><td style="border-left:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-right:solid #000000 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1.5pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.875pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">98%</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Magicbricks data shows that consumer demand is mostly for 2BHK followed by 1BHK, 3BHK, and 4BHK.&nbsp;</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p><div dir="ltr" style="margin-left:0pt;" align="left"><table style="border:none;border-collapse:collapse;"><colgroup><col width="202"><col width="151"><col width="86"><col width="86"></colgroup><tbody><tr style="height:15pt"><td colspan="4" style="border-left:solid #000000 1.5pt;border-right:solid #000000 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-top:solid #000000 1.5pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">By BHK Type</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:15pt"><td style="border-left:solid #000000 1.5pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.875pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">1 BHK</span></p></td><td style="border-left:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.875pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">2 BHK</span></p></td><td style="border-left:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.875pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">3 BHK</span></p></td><td style="border-left:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-right:solid #000000 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.875pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">4 BHK</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:15pt"><td style="border-left:solid #000000 1.5pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1.5pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.875pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">28%</span></p></td><td style="border-left:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1.5pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.875pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">55%</span></p></td><td style="border-left:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1.5pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.875pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">15%</span></p></td><td style="border-left:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-right:solid #000000 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1.5pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.875pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">2%</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p><div dir="ltr" style="margin-left:0pt;" align="left"><table style="border:none;border-collapse:collapse;"><colgroup><col width="202"><col width="151"><col width="86"><col width="86"></colgroup><tbody><tr style="height:15pt"><td colspan="4" style="border-left:solid #000000 1.5pt;border-right:solid #000000 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-top:solid #000000 1.5pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Size Range (Sq.ft.) By BHK Type</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:15pt"><td style="border-left:solid #000000 1.5pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.875pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">1 BHK</span></p></td><td style="border-left:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.875pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">2 BHK</span></p></td><td style="border-left:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.875pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">3 BHK</span></p></td><td style="border-left:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-right:solid #000000 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.875pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">4 BHK</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:15pt"><td style="border-left:solid #000000 1.5pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1.5pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.875pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">400-750</span></p></td><td style="border-left:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1.5pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.875pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">650-1300</span></p></td><td style="border-left:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1.5pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.875pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">1100-1900</span></p></td><td style="border-left:solid #000000 0.875pt;border-right:solid #000000 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1.5pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.875pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">1650-2200</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">For rented accommodation, the average monthly rental in Borivali west is Rs 26,000-40,000.&nbsp;</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Overview of Borivali West</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Borivali West is well served by the Western Express Highway, railways, and metro. It also offers good connectivity via road. IT and MNCs are located nearby and are easily accessible. Due to the availability of schools, shopping malls, and hospitals the locality positions itself as a preferred residential area.&nbsp;However, currently the locality faces traffic pile up at the Western Highway junction but residents expect that future metro connectivity will give them another option.</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p><ol style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;"><li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Well served by Western Express Highway, Suburban railway (local train), and Metro&nbsp;</span></p></li><li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Good road connectivity</span></p></li><li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">IT and MNCs easily accessible</span></p></li><li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Availability of schools, shopping malls, and hospitals</span></p></li><li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Positioned as a primary residential area</span></p></li><li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">24 hrs water and electricity supply</span></p></li><li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Traffic jams at few locations</span></p></li></ol></span></div></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
